# Add an item to a list, back out to MY LISTS, and that list's card reads the new total (R2).
# Groceries seeds 3 items (Buy milk done, Buy eggs open, Bread open) -> starts at "1/3 done".
launch
tap text "Groceries"
type id "list.newItemField" "Batteries"
tap id "list.addButton"
expect text "Batteries"
tap id "list.backButton"
expect text "1/4 done"
